      "content": "true, but \"inclusive\" is a pretty vague term though. if a country realizes that following WTO rules or international mandates is actually hurting its local industries and making people lose jobs at home, is it still \"better\" to force them to follow those global rules for the sake of \"stability\"? aren't there times when protecting national autonomy is actually more important than following a global trend?",
